[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6121.99, "timestamp": "01:42:01", "text": "非常非常强？是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6125.43, "timestamp": "01:42:05", "text": "非常强壮。我确实喜欢，嗯，我确实喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6129.87, "timestamp": "01:42:09", "text": "Jagger Master 加红牛。我喜欢葡萄酒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6132.87, "timestamp": "01:42:12", "text": "我非常喜欢啤酒。葡萄酒和啤酒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6134.149, "timestamp": "01:42:14", "text": "这是我的最佳组合。我总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6136.39, "timestamp": "01:42:16", "text": "多喝葡萄酒和啤酒。我情绪高涨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6138.149, "timestamp": "01:42:18", "text": "与对葡萄酒和啤酒的耐受程度相比"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6141.03, "timestamp": "01:42:21", "text": "伏特加酒。柠檬做。我不知道这是什么"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6142.104, "timestamp": "01:42:22", "author": "@vinzidcreator", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/6N6hlttqAPJW-h4WV0cWFHqds0lBhXYYguTso6VNcwcD9Pl0uHdL7RphVieFjKCvwzUnqOh1=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "im so used to patiala pegs that normal pegs feel like 30ml to me :,)"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6142.87, "timestamp": "01:42:22", "text": "是。真奇怪。你可以直接去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6145.83, "timestamp": "01:42:25", "text": "任何一家公司都可以，然后你就能得到它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6148.629, "timestamp": "01:42:28", "text": "你会明白的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6150.709, "timestamp": "01:42:30", "text": "但如果你打算去k，然后你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6152.55, "timestamp": "01:42:32", "text": "看到上班族喝醉了，不要帮忙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6156.709, "timestamp": "01:42:36", "text": "他们就像我一样。太恶心了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6158.629, "timestamp": "01:42:38", "text": "等等，你非得走回去吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6161.03, "timestamp": "01:42:41", "text": "打车还是回家之类的？不，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6162.55, "timestamp": "01:42:42", "text": "我没有那样做。我没有做过那件事。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6164.79, "timestamp": "01:42:44", "text": "就在我和我的朋友们之后不久"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6167.189, "timestamp": "01:42:47", "text": "我们在郭，但我们没喝酒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6169.43, "timestamp": "01:42:49", "text": "酒精。我们当时就像在唱歌一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6171.35, "timestamp": "01:42:51", "text": "当时已是半夜，大概过了两点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6174.79, "timestamp": "01:42:54", "text": "三、我们正要回去，嗯，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6177.669, "timestamp": "01:42:57", "text": "那里有一群看起来很醉的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6179.43, "timestamp": "01:42:59", "text": "真的吐在了他们身上，然后"}]